5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry about social friction. We need to know how past arrangements failed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to check if the current spots match where people actually park.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is chaotic. I need to see the physical layout and usage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Everyone asks about costs. I need to see the actual financial records.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Who maintains this? I need to understand the ongoing administrative burden.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, are you looking at the ledger? That seems relevant to my concern.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the sticker register to see who actually rides daily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’m going to watch the morning departures to see the bottleneck.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Yes, the ledger. And I’ll check the ward park costs for comparison.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look at the treasurer’s file and the complaint log.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll review the five years of minutes to see if rules were ever changed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,And the rain exposure. Wet bikes cause complaints.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll also check the supplier’s frame trial. It affects usability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,The ward park data will show if we’re competitive.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The complaint log shows who is actually affected.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
