35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The minutes show no review in five years. The complaints died out because no one was responsible.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes. Daily riders prefer paying over equal claims.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Watching the entrance, four times someone had to shift a bike. The upper rail takes twenty seconds to load.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ledger is empty for capital work. The ward park charges 2,600 yen with a waitlist.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on cash. The neighbouring block had arrears and absenteeism.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, the absenteeism is worrying. A paid system might drive people away.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, if the ward park is full, our residents have nowhere else to go.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The physical effort of the racks is significant. It’s not just about space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The cost of doing nothing is high. We need a sustainable model.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The administrative load is real. We can’t just add billing without support.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we go paid, we risk the same social decay as the neighbouring block.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But the daily riders are willing to pay. It might be fairer than the lottery.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Shared racks avoid the ""shoving match"" but require maintenance.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The ledger shows we have no buffer. Any income helps.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a system that doesn’t collapse under one person’s weight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
