60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A risks social isolation. Option B is rigid. Option C is chaotic but fair.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option A aligns with what the daily riders want. It’s practical.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option C solves the morning bottleneck. No one owns a spot, so no one blocks it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A brings in money. The ledger is empty, so we need revenue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A adds work. But the neighbouring block’s failure was due to lack of enforcement, not the model.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, how do we ensure enforcement without creating a burden?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,We can rotate the duty. Or use the income to hire help.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,The racks need greasing. That’s a small task.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The 2,600 yen is a benchmark. We can charge less.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we charge, we must track it. That’s the three hours a month.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I’m leaning towards A, but only if we address the social risk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I vote A. It’s what the people who use it most want.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I vote C. It’s the most equitable and solves the physical conflict.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I vote A. We need the funds.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote A. The administrative cost is manageable if we are organized.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
